# Mechanic: distinguish the two separate mono-color mana activations.
# Forcing: Prairie Stream is the only mana source; select white or blue explicitly.
# AI behavior: no opposing permanents or hand, and no turn advance is needed.
# Failure modes: equal labels fail before input; wrong pool or identity fails after input.
# Card roles: Prairie Stream supplies mana; Ornithopter proves continued play.
# Libraries prevent decking. Life totals do not affect the observed path.
# Protocol path: ActivateMana actions, PerformActionResp, player mana pool update.
# The browser assertions, not the puzzle win condition, define success.
